        "subject": "Thank you for your admission enquiry - Sree Siddaganga College",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Dear {{ $('Validate and Prepare Enquiry').item.json.fullName }},\\n\\nThank you for your interest in Sree Siddaganga College of Arts, Science and Commerce. We have received your admission enquiry.\\n\\nEnquiry ID: {{ $('Validate and Prepare Enquiry').item.json.enquiryId }}\\nProgramme of interest: {{ $('Validate and Prepare Enquiry').item.json.course }}\\nAdmission year: {{ $('Validate and Prepare Enquiry').item.json.admissionYear }}\\n\\nThe college team can follow up with you about programme details and the admission process. Please contact the college directly for official eligibility and admission information.\\n\\nRegards,\\nAdmissions Enquiry Team",
